  (325, 351, 'newbie', 'Hi, I''m Wenju, a 20-year web dev & design pro with technical and creative expertise.From 2006-2016, I was a leading DNN theme developer, ranking Top 3 in global DNN marketplace sales, mastering front-end dev and custom themes.From 2016-2026, I worked as a front-end dev for educational software in Beijing, building and optimizing large-scale learning platforms, honing scalable architecture and responsive design.I specialize in graphic, logo, and vector design, handling all your web and branding needs. High-quality work on time, unlimited revisions, 100% satisfaction guarantee.', '["前端开发", "政企项目"]', '[]', 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL),
